WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:11.480
Mother, how can we please You best?

2
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.520
There is a good question Shri Mataji:

3
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:23.128
How can we please You best?

4
00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:26.000
Shri Mataji: I have no desires.

5
00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:32.920
I don’t know [Laughter; applause].

6
00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:47.920
You see, inside Me is complete peace

7
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.720
and complete satisfaction.

8
00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:54.880
There is nothing that is needed inside.

9
00:00:55.840 --> 00:01:02.360
But the ripples of that joy flow outward all the time.

10
00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:08.238
And when it reaches your shores, you see, it comes back.

11
00:01:08.238 --> 00:01:12.000
And it weaves a beautiful pattern,

12
00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:19.200
The reciprocity, how much you reciprocate is the way the pattern is beautiful.

13
00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:26.520
pattern is beautiful. It’s delicate,
 it’s powerful. It’s so soothing

14
00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:32.640
and it weaves the complete beauty of bhakti.

15
00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:40.360
So much so that this ocean of joy itself gets turbulent,

16
00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:51.111
and I really swing with it. And it is not easy to describe that beautiful feeling of tremendous joy.

17
00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:58.285
The first thing you have to know that  I love you very much,

18
00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:01.000
with all my heart, with all my soul.

19
00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:07.120
In the same way, try to love Me with all sincerity and trust.

20
00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:08.620
May God bless you all!

21
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:14.280
Now I’ll speak for one minute about this meditation.

22
00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:23.054
Yesterday I told you about putting your attention to different areas,

23
00:02:23.054 --> 00:02:26.040
the “pradesha” [region] or the chakras.

24
00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:32.280
And the chakra, as you know, has got “mandalas” [orb], it’s the areas.

25
00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:37.022
So, when you pay attention to the chakras, where do you pay attention to,

26
00:02:37.022 --> 00:02:38.120
is the point.

27
00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:41.360
Actually, you pay attention to the deity.

28
00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:47.320
Now this deity- supposing you are taking the name of Shri Rama,

29
00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:53.200
you are trying to establish Shri Rama within your heart, Right Heart Chakra.

30
00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.000
Now at that time, what do you do?

31
00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:57.280
You say the mantra.

32
00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:02.800
But there’s another way which is easier. Because you are saying a mantra

33
00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:09.038
in a way that is not so much intelligible there,

34
00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:13.491
to Shri Rama. But first of all, if you study the qualities of Shri Rama,

35
00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:15.680
what were his qualities?

36
00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:20.360
And if you manifest those qualities through your character,

37
00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:23.880
then it’s very easy to please Shri Rama.

38
00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:26.120
What is the quality of Shri Ganesha?

39
00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:29.160
He’s entirely surrendered to Mother,

40
00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:31.160
even Father doesn’t bother Him.

41
00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:33.320
What is the quality of Christ?

42
00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.800
He forgives those who have crucified Him.

43
00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:38.800
He can go through all kinds of tapasya.

44
00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:41.490
What is the quality of Shri Krishna

45
00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:43.400
for whom everything is a leela?

46
00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:47.461
Like that, when you take the name of Shri Krishna,

47
00:03:47.461 --> 00:03:51.268
do you see everything as a witness?

48
00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:58.172
If effortlessly that happens to you, you should know that you have established Shri Krishna.

49
00:03:58.976 --> 00:04:01.451
It’s the most difficult thing, is to establish Me because I am Mahamaya

50
00:04:01.633 --> 00:04:05.560
to establish Me." because I am Mahamaya,

51
00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:10.040
And the facets are so many:

52
00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:17.760
sixteen thousand into, raised to power one thousand.

53
00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:23.400
So, it’s difficult. But whatever things you can grasp and think, “

54
00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:28.480
and think this is Mother's quality,
try to imbibe that within yourself.

55
00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:31.280
That doesn't mean you start
shouting at Bhoots first.

56
00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:34.680
So, first, what is the first quality of Mother?

57
00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:40.320
That She came on this earth and She has worked for people

58
00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:42.840
who are nowhere near Her.

59
00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:46.840
She stooped down to elevate others.

60
00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:50.805
And then gradually you can understand that

61
00:04:51.212 --> 00:04:56.910
that this quality will take you to higher qualities than you think.

62
00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:01.960
So, among the seven colours to begin with, I am the green colour.

63
00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:04.130
because I am in the centre.

64
00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:07.400
Because I’m in the centre. Green colour is the colour that you get it from the Mother Earth.

65
00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:11.040
So first you must establish the quality of the Mother Earth

66
00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:15.240
that she sucks up all the problems, gives you the best that she has.

67
00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:18.440
Start with the Mother Earth, so you start with the Kundalini.

68
00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:21.720
That’s how one should start imbibing the pure Kundalini form of Mother, is purity,

69
00:05:22.366 --> 00:05:28.550
In imbibing the pure Kundalini form of Mother, is purity,

70
00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:32.520
is cleansing purity.

71
00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:34.765
But are you pure?

72
00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:36.800
Are you pure in your heart?

73
00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:42.291
Just think of that. And then, with purity you start.

74
00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:45.960
That is how you have to establish different chakras,

75
00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:52.839
of purifying all the chakras  and ultimately when you have purified all of them,

76
00:05:52.839 --> 00:05:54.120
you have established Me.

77
00:05:55.200 --> 00:06:04.608
Thus, we understand we have to grow within and without

78
00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:08.160
by spreading our light horizontally now.

79
00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:14.640
Only when you become like the deities your light will spread horizontally,

80
00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:16.200
otherwise not.

81
00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:21.280
That is what we say that somebody has got the “siddha” [power]

82
00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:27.399
of a particular deity, is the siddha of Ganesha, is the siddha of Shri Krishna.

83
00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:33.115
So first, when you develop their manifesting outside powers,  you see,

84
00:06:33.115 --> 00:06:38.160
of kindness, compassion, of witness and all those,

85
00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:40.280
then you can develop their other qualities, which are on the destructive side.

86
00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:42.400
Which are on the destructive side.

87
00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:48.438
First the constructive side you must develop, then the destructive automatically will work,

88
00:06:48.438 --> 00:06:49.571
You don't have to worry.

89
00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:56.560
Like one side of Shri Krishna,
He was playing with with ordinary herds men

90
00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.520
and the- another side, he was killing rakshasas.

91
00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:06.165
So first, you have to become like Him and then

92
00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:08.680
automatically you will get the other powers.

93
00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.840
You don’t give swords to stupid people, do you?

94
00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:21.973
So one would understand
that one has to develop these qualities

95
00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:27.720
of construction of all the incarnations and then you become

96
00:07:27.778 --> 00:07:33.915
empowered by the destructive qualities of those incarnations.

97
00:07:33.915 --> 00:07:38.560
If you understand the sequence, then the fanaticism will never grow

98
00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:44.145
because fanaticism comes  when you start thinking that you are the incarnation or

99
00:07:44.145 --> 00:07:46.818
whatever incarnation has done, you can do.
thinking that you are the incarnation, or

100
00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:51.280
Like Christians felt they could become Kalki without His Advent even.

101
00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:55.733
And they took a piece, a rifle or you can say, a gun in one hand

102
00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:57.000
and the Bible in another hand.

103
00:07:57.720 --> 00:08:01.748
And the Muslims, they never believed that Mohammad was a prophet [an incarnation].

104
00:08:01.748 --> 00:08:08.052
So they think because he was not a prophet- he was a prophet but he was not an incarnation.

105
00:08:08.052 --> 00:08:10.420
So, we could also do the same what he was doing.”

106
00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:13.560
In the same way, Hindus also, when they become fanatic,

107
00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:20.080
they start thinking they have become great incarnations.

108
00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:23.240
So, discretion must be used again

109
00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:28.680
that you develop all the constructive side of an incarnation.

110
00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:34.920
So, after the seminar you have to remember my word about it

111
00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:42.200
that you have to concentrate on a deity to imbibe the qualities of that deity.

112
00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:49.240
Otherwise you have no communication with the deity, and no use saying the mantras.

113
00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:54.132
Like we would say that, “My this chakra is catching or that chakra is catching.” Why?

114
00:08:54.132 --> 00:08:55.942
"That chakra is catching." Why?

115
00:08:56.120 --> 00:09:01.638
Because there is that lacking of that chakra that you have not yet imbibed within yourself.

116
00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:07.640
So you must try to identify yourself with the qualities,

117
00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:12.416
the constructive qualities of every deity

118
00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:18.955
and that’s how you should believe that you are now correcting your chakras with the mantras.

119
00:09:19.251 --> 00:09:26.105
Otherwise I’ll find all the Sahaja yogis carrying all the thousand weapons of the Devi in their hands, suddenly

120
00:09:26.105 --> 00:09:28.198
thinking they have all become Devis.

121
00:09:28.198 --> 00:09:31.963
Now I hope when you go back home, you won’t forget my words

122
00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:37.792
and try to concentrate on your pradesha, on your areas of different chakras

123
00:09:37.792 --> 00:09:42.322
which are not all right and which are troubling you.

124
00:09:42.322 --> 00:09:50.886
And try to imbibe those qualities. And nourish, nourish also the ones that are all right

125
00:09:50.886 --> 00:09:54.367
by understanding the qualities of the deities.

126
00:09:54.662 --> 00:10:03.732
Then only you will be amazed that your powers will flow without even thinking about it. It’s not difficult for you,

127
00:10:04.365 --> 00:10:06.024
it is not at all difficult.

128
00:10:06.229 --> 00:10:13.212
But know that instead of paying attention to other’s chakras better look after your own chakras.

129
00:10:13.732 --> 00:10:16.969
If your chakras are all right, you won’t even catch from others.

130
00:10:17.653 --> 00:10:21.867
Another dangerous thing people do is to correct the chakras of others.

131
00:10:21.867 --> 00:10:25.744
Individually it should never be done, collectively you may do.

132
00:10:26.131 --> 00:10:32.941
But it’s better not to enter into that exercise till you have reached certain state of confidence.

133
00:10:33.237 --> 00:10:39.107
This is for your further movement into the second era of Sahaja Yoga.

134
00:10:39.493 --> 00:10:43.959
And I hope I will live to see the second era fully.

135
00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:46.460
Gregoire: Until the third, fourth one?

136
00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:52.439
Shri Mataji: But first second one. You desire for the second. You cannot jump, you know.

137
00:10:52.439 --> 00:10:59.571
Now here you should today say to yourself that in your heart promise that,

138
00:10:59.571 --> 00:11:05.354
“Mother I will now correct myself completely for my own benefit

139
00:11:05.969 --> 00:11:17.838
and I will project my mind to think discreetly how I can help to propagate Sahaja Yoga to others.”

140
00:11:18.112 --> 00:11:22.961
With discretion, we should not go and talk to a bull about Sahaja Yoga.

